 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>【Adjustable Cat Ramp】Designed to fit standard and automatic litter boxes, this cat ramp adjustable height. Our litter box ramp delivers unbeatable stability and anti-slip performance helping kittens, senior cats, and pets with limited mobility enter and exit easily</li>\n  <li>【Easy to install】These cat steps for litter box use feature four stackable modules that can be freely combined to suit different box heights. Simply align each cat litter step with the side panel slots for quick, tool-free installation that adapts to your cat’s daily routine</li>\n  <li>【Litter Catching Function】The grid/mesh design effectively filters and traps litter from your cat’s paws before they step onto the floor. Simply lift the lid to recycle litter back into the box, keeping your home clean and tidy</li>\n  <li>【Durable &amp; Easy to Clean】Sturdy construction supports everyday use without bending. Dirt-resistant materials are easy to wipe or rinse clean, ensuring your cat steps stay hygienic and fresh<br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/64236133-cb3a-4a71-9e8f-0303a5035366.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/ead39208-61e5-4be0-bfc1-c3b36b9405c0.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/c8767b4b-ff48-43cb-b144-0ce38478db92.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li>\n </ul>\n",
